id: drag-and-pinch-page
section: Scrolling and gestures
item: A real drag-scroll and a two-finger pinch on an ordinary page: the pinch out zooms in, the pinch in comes back, the content stays drawn
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-long-static.html
kit: cavekit-input-bridging.md R3
calibrate 'sel:#content p'
drag 480 900 480 250
expect card-scroll-min 400
pinch 384 500 100 400
wait zoom 10
expect zoom-min 1.5
expect content 0,150,756,600 'sel:body'
pinch 384 500 400 100
wait zoom 10
pinch 384 500 400 100
wait zoom 10
expect zoom 1.0 0.15
